<section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A FEW FINAL DETAILS</span><h1>Checkout</h1><p>Your order will be on its way in no time.</p></section>
<section class="section two-column"><form class="panel form-stack" data-checkout><h2>Delivery details</h2><label>Full name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label><label>Phone number<input name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required></label><label>Delivery address<textarea name="address" rows="3" placeholder="House/building, road, area, and a nearby landmark" autocomplete="street-address" required></textarea></label><p class="muted checkout-area-note" data-checkout-area></p><label>Delivery instructions (optional)<input name="instructions" placeholder="Apartment, floor, gate, or other directions"></label><h2>Payment</h2><label>Payment method<select name="payment_method"><option value="cod">Cash on delivery</option><option value="bkash">bKash</option><option value="nagad">Nagad</option><option value="card">Bank card</option></select></label><label>Coupon code (optional)<input name="coupon_code"></label><p class="form-message" data-message></p><button class="button">Place order</button></form><aside class="panel" data-checkout-summary></aside></section>
